// Kiddo School — EXTRA CLASS · Places in the Community:
// /extra-classes/places-in-the-community/learn/ lessons. One simple kid
// guide per place, in the set's tour order (learn & imagine → safe & cared
// for → food & shopping → around the town → getting around → parks & green
// places). The original flashcard sits LEFT with the drawing canvas; this
// guide sits RIGHT, written so a KID can follow it: what the place is, who
// works there, what we do there, the steps of a visit, and one way to play
// it at home. Written fresh — the library pages in data-places-in-community.mjs
// answer WHAT the place is and WHAT we do there; no text is shared between
// the two. The US/UK/CA pairs (movie theater/cinema, drugstore/chemist,
// gas/petrol station, dentist's surgery/office, leisure centre/sports
// center, trolley/cart, rubbish/garbage) are named in both flavors wherever
// the place carries them.
