  ask:'"What do we say to open wide?" (ahh!) "Who counts our teeth?" (the dentist) "How do we keep sugar bugs away at home?" (brush, brush, brush — twice a day)',
  childSay:'Your child might count the family’s teeth at dinner (up to 32 per grown-up, they will learn), play dentist with a spoon mirror and a very firm "open wider, please", or demand the polish sound "bzzz" during bedtime brushing.',
